%I A401447 #5 Oct 28 2026 00:10:13
%S A401447 2,10,38,254,1638,11928
%N A401447 Number of one-sided polyforms with n cells in the honeycomb of the 7-faced Voronoi cell of the point (1/8, 1/6, 5/12) under space group Pn-3m (No. 224, origin choice 1).
%C A401447 The cell is a 7-faced space-filling polyhedron (3^2 4^3 6^2 faces) arising as the Voronoi cell of the orbit of the point (1/8, 1/6, 5/12) under space group Pn-3m (No. 224, origin choice 1); its honeycomb has 48 cell types (translation classes), each cell with 7 face-neighbors. Polyforms are face-connected clusters of cells, counted up to lattice translation and the proper (orientation-preserving) symmetries of the honeycomb.
%C A401447 The symmetry group G of the tiling has order 48 modulo lattice translations (24 proper), and the counts satisfy the Burnside identity |G|*free(n) = Sum_g Fix_g(n).
%H A401447 Mathias Bernhard, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.07160">The Josehedron: A space-filling plesiohedron based on the Fischer-Koch S Triply Periodic Minimal Surface</a>, arXiv:2604.07160 [cs.CG], 2026.
%H A401447 Tyler Satchel Orden, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22502081">plesiohedron-census: certified space-filling polyhedra from a gated agentic search (code, certificates, catalog)</a>, Zenodo, 2026.
%H A401447 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_space_groups">List of space groups</a>.
%o A401447 (C++) // See A401259.
%Y A401447 Cf. A398957, A398958, A398959 (Josehedron polyforms, same enumerator); A385028, A397707-A397709 (polyforms on other space-filler honeycombs); A400457-A400461, A401255-A401258 (polyforms on three further space-filling cells, same enumerator).
%Y A401447 Cf. A401259 (fixed), A401448 (free).
